# Template for the frontend env. Copy to `.env.local` and fill in the
# value — `.env.local` is git-ignored; only this example template is committed.
#
# VITE_API_KEY must equal the backend's ASSISTANT_API_KEY (see backend/.env.dev).
# The hook (src/hooks/useChatStream.ts) sends it two ways:
#   - X-API-Key header on the /sessions HTTP calls
#   - ?api_key= query param on the /ws/chat WebSocket handshake
#     (browsers can't set headers on a WS handshake, hence the query param).
VITE_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME
